    "ASDisplayNode/ContextController/SwiftSignalKit are translated to UIKit and the existing ZoenAttachmentPresentationOwner.",
    "The actual already-ported glass and Display layer spring implementations are reused; there is no new effect tree, animation dependency or private morph bridge.",
    "Plain two-line titles/default17pt font and the currently authorized Photos send-as-file action only; no rich/subtitle/badge/submenu or extracted-row branch.",
    "Existing Photos revision/ordered selection/native final caption authority is unchanged; invalidation retires the menu rather than maintaining a second selection owner.",
    "Reduced motion retains opacity and removes transforms. Close samples the in-flight presentation geometry; retirement/window loss synchronously removes ownership.",
    "Source geometry formulas are retained. Width additionally caps to viewport minus32pt for unusually narrow hosts. Content overflow uses a native scroll view.",
    "The menu does not resign/reparent the caption input. Native background/menu invalidation and accessibility restoration use the existing owner."
